    "details": {
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>Red slaadi gather in enormous crowds in Limbo, where they brawl and sing croaking songs while forever tearing apart and remaking islands of drifting planar matter. When they meet other creatures, red slaadi may want to play with them, talk with them telepathically, or eat them, and these urges shift from one moment to the next. They instinctively spare anyone carrying slaad eggs, which red slaadi implant with their claws, or bearing another slaad curse.</p>",
        "public": ""
      },
